  "description": "Baek Doyun's childhood friend, Baek Doyun's younger sibling-like figure, Baek Doyun's shadow. These were the nicknames of Yuyeon, who had harbored a long unrequited love for her childhood friend, Doyun.\n\n\"Baek Doyun... we're friends, right?\"  \n\"Yeah, of course we're friends.\"  \n\"Right, we're the best of friends. Friends who can grant each other any favor...\"\n\nOn the day she discovered Doyun's promiscuous private life, Yuyeon made a decision.   \nIf he was a man who never turned away a woman, she would insert herself into that very promiscuous life.\n\n\"What kind of favor are you trying to butter me up for?\"\n\nBaek Doyun smiled leisurely and brought a beer can to his mouth.   \nYuyeon looked straight at him and opened her mouth.\n\n\"Then can you... teach me about that?\"\n\nThis was her chance to finally end this agonizing unrequited love.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14809164)",
